Validation Notes

Detailed validation scenarios, operational acceptance criteria, representative environments, and evidence requirements shall be developed within the AVIA Validation domain.

Validation shall maintain traceability between approved decisions, executed actions, resulting vehicle behavior, and execution-state evidence.

No specific execution technology shall be required by this objective.
